<description>&lt;p&gt;The junta carried out double-tap airstrikes that hit civilians, intensifying the conflict in Myanmar. ASEAN members remain divided as some pursue closer ties with the junta while others debate reintegration, and the bloc faces a dilemma over its response. The military government is lobbying for investment in its rare-earth sector, which is dominated by China, and it summoned the German envoy after a controversial video. Meanwhile, 2,332 battle-related deaths were recorded in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.france24.com/en/tv-shows/the-observers/20261113-myanmar-junta-airstrikes-civilians&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimgFBVV95cUxOelhQTXluM0EyUV9QWEJ4NFdkWk5NQVFzTm5kWUFyQkk3UXdUMlVsOVFlNmpNMzZ1ZVlDYy1nbldweC00RW1uQnFQU1NnT0RzNTZzS3ZHN0w5RDZiQ1dOVjlkZk03djltN1VEZUlNci14NFdSYXRqZEZLbzNFZ2dSbUNCcW9ZQl9ZSmdTcXdkd05raUJoZl9INTh3?oc=5&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinAFBVV95cUxOZ0dya0U4REZuM2U1c2d6T3lISzJZZGFfM3JVcjVNUTNZN0dBZU5HWjZHcDhzUnAxNTdGVENsT1FBb0Y0WTljenlfb0kwVWFPZkVQaktpekVSeDd5bFEwMzVaT3MzSUt0Q3VMMGk1OE4tVkdhYUJ1c1MycHFqSlpJdFlNczRLWTJFT1duR0RhUGVTVms1QTZBczN1cnE?oc=5&quot;&gt;Dawn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiwgFBVV95cUxOdlMtZzUxWkhvOGh0UkJNV0lGSXJpV1dRa3liRFk1ODBMUXJEbHpoZUF1d1VheDdUeTlqVzJweGhqQlFMaE0tUm0wanV0OHkxT0FkQjhrSmxjYkJLbHFIRlFCeVZ0Z2xuV2YwazY3Z3FCOXRMVmhJbTNUU05xV21MeHdJNXJjLTBSR1FpU2lIamZDSkp6dXMzRWhzRV9lSjdMQkduckFzVU1oUzdJRG81dnBDaGVxVGUwUkozYlBkcDJQUQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;CNN&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiowFBVV95cUxPZl9XaGdMNHJBNTVxcTNBOG1TWW5iRlllRmExM0o5Y2VCT0llS1ZuZGxRV1lZcTNDUGQyMjFQSlhYajQwNUxVQ0xRSldHU3NzRjdDdmFjMm9sdUlVMm1pN2NxM19zZkVaT1hzMlJETVF4R0tEZlF0MkFVV0I5T0I0WEo1c0wy